### Why this fixes the design:
The fontSize={1} parameter on your Grid and the slotProps approach were confusing the Material-UI CSS engine for TextField. Adding fullWidth natively makes the fields align perfectly. Removing the MenuProps.anchorOrigin allows the dropdowns to naturally open *upwards* when you add multiple rows and run out of space at the bottom of your screen, preventing the UI from breaking.
